### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@auth = Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM0NQ==

### -------- Module 1/2: Employees & Documents --------

### List employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Get single employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### List documents for an employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/?employee=1
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Download a document (Module 2 / 11)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/1/download/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### -------- Module 3: Excel Import --------

### Import employees from Excel (multipart - use REST Client's file picker or curl)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees/import/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### -------- Module 4: Excel Export --------

### Export employee list
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/export/?type=employees
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Export department list
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/export/?type=departments
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Export salary report
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/export/?type=salary
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Export attendance report
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/export/?type=attendance
Authorization: {{auth}}

### -------- Module 5: CSV Import/Export --------

### Export employees as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/export-csv/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### -------- Module 6/7/8/9: PDF, Salary Slip, QR, ID Card --------

### Employee profile PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/profile-pdf/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Salary slip PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/salary-slip/?month=June&year=2026
Authorization: {{auth}}

### QR code (PNG)
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/qr-code/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Employee ID card PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1/id-card/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### -------- Module 10/11: Reports --------

### Generate a report (POST body: report_type + format)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reports/generate/
Authorization: {{auth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "report_type": "SALARY",
  "format": "PDF"
}

### List generated reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Download a generated report by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/1/download/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### -------- Module 12: Dashboard --------

### Dashboard summary (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Dashboard export - PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/export/?file_format=PDF
Authorization: {{auth}}

### Dashboard export - Excel
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/export/?file_format=EXCEL
Authorization: {{auth}}
